-- Phase 9: Tōro activation — flip is_active=TRUE on parent + 8 sub-agents
-- Generated by Kaihanga 2026-05-13 (queued; applies AFTER Reo's Phase 3 editorial pass lands)
--
-- After Reo's editorial merge migration canonicalises brand drift in the 9 Tōro prompts
-- (lowercase 'assembl', no 'SMS-first', no 'Tōroa', adds CROSS-AGENT AWARENESS + EVIDENCE PACK
-- OUTPUTS sections), this migration flips them all from is_active=FALSE to is_active=TRUE
-- in one shot.
--
-- WAITS ON:
--   * Reo's PR landing UPDATE statements on 9 Tōro prompts:
--     - toro (parent), toro-education, toro-email, toro-family, toro-health,
--       toro-home, toro-homework, toro-logistics, toro-money
